# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release signing material - NEVER commit any of these.
#
# Losing the keystore means you can never publish an update to the same app:
# Android only installs an upgrade signed by the same key, so a lost key forces
# every user to uninstall (losing their data) before installing a new build.
# A leaked keystore lets anyone else publish an "update" under your identity.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
keystore.properties
DuoLink/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
DuoLink/keystore/
DuoLink/server/data/
